<title>USA: Biopool International places 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Biopool International places 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>VENTURA, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biopool International Inc said on Wednesday it has completed a private placement of 500,000 common shares at a price of $2.1875 per share.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of about $1.02 million will be used to help fund Biopool's acquisition of the Blood Group Serology (BGS) business unit of Organon Teknika Corp. That deal is expected to cost a total $4.5 million in cash, and it is expected to close on December 31.</p>
<p>Biopool has also signed a $3.5 million term loan facility from Sanwa Bank to fund the acquisition.</p>
<p>&quot;(The financing) has resulted in relatively little dilution at a time when we feel our common stock is undervalued,&quot; Michael Bick, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
